{
 "id": "seg2",
 "title": "挡不住扳手",
 "pill": 2,
 "total": 90.18,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 1.28,
   "speechStart": 1.6,
   "speechEnd": 2.687
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "扳手攻击，就是用暴力或威胁，逼持币的人交出私钥，或者转账。",
   "spoken": "扳手攻击，就是用暴力或威胁，逼持币的人交出私钥，或者转账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-01.wav",
   "start": 3.1,
   "dur": 5.76,
   "speechStart": 3.203,
   "speechEnd": 8.685
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "这个名字来自一幅漫画。",
   "spoken": "这个名字来自一幅漫画。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-02.wav",
   "start": 9.08,
   "dur": 2.0,
   "speechStart": 9.18,
   "speechEnd": 10.849
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "花大价钱买算力，破解不了加密，买一把便宜的扳手，就够了。",
   "spoken": "花大价钱买算力，破解不了加密，买一把便宜的扳手，就够了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-03.wav",
   "start": 11.3,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 11.3,
   "speechEnd": 16.133
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "密码学挡不住扳手。",
   "spoken": "密码学挡不住扳手。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-04.wav",
   "start": 16.56,
   "dur": 1.92,
   "speechStart": 16.653,
   "speechEnd": 18.284
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "攻击者知道你是谁，住在哪，有多少资产，最便宜的办法，就是找到你本人。",
   "spoken": "攻击者知道你是谁，住在哪，有多少资产，最便宜的办法，就是找到你本人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-05.wav",
   "start": 18.7,
   "dur": 6.88,
   "speechStart": 18.793,
   "speechEnd": 25.358
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "打个比方，你给家门装了一把银行级的锁。",
   "spoken": "打个比方，你给家门装了一把银航级的锁。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-06.wav",
   "start": 25.8,
   "dur": 3.52,
   "speechStart": 25.895,
   "speechEnd": 29.15
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "可你的门牌号、作息时间、保险柜里有多少钱，都印在一张贴在网上的海报上。",
   "spoken": "可你的门牌号、作息时间、保险柜里有多少钱，都印在一张贴在网上的海报上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-07.wav",
   "start": 29.54,
   "dur": 6.64,
   "speechStart": 29.54,
   "speechEnd": 35.944
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "锁越好，劫匪越不会去撬锁，而是等你回家。",
   "spoken": "锁越好，劫匪越不会去撬锁，而是等你回家。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-08.wav",
   "start": 36.4,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 36.494,
   "speechEnd": 40.191
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "比喻在这里不成立，劫匪要先知道你有钱。",
   "spoken": "比喻在这里不成立，劫匪要先知道你有钱。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-09.wav",
   "start": 40.62,
   "dur": 3.76,
   "speechStart": 40.721,
   "speechEnd": 44.179
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "而链上资产的特点是，地址一旦和身份连上，余额对全世界公开。",
   "spoken": "而链上资产的特点是，地址一旦和身份连上，余额对全世界公开。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-10.wav",
   "start": 44.6,
   "dur": 5.68,
   "speechStart": 44.6,
   "speechEnd": 50.074
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "所以攻击的第一步，是关联。",
   "spoken": "所以攻击的第一步，是关联。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-11.wav",
   "start": 50.5,
   "dur": 2.8,
   "speechStart": 50.595,
   "speechEnd": 53.143
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "把一个链上地址，连到一个真实的人，一个真实的住址。",
   "spoken": "把一个链上地址，连到一个真实的人，一个真实的住址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-12.wav",
   "start": 53.52,
   "dur": 4.88,
   "speechStart": 53.615,
   "speechEnd": 58.187
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "线索有三类。",
   "spoken": "线索有三类。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-13.wav",
   "start": 58.62,
   "dur": 1.28,
   "speechStart": 58.62,
   "speechEnd": 59.736
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "公开信息，比如社交媒体、采访、会议照片。",
   "spoken": "公开信息，比如社交媒体、采访、会议照片。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-14.wav",
   "start": 60.12,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speechStart": 60.218,
   "speechEnd": 64.645
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "数据泄露，比如 KYC 资料、电商订单、客服工单。",
   "spoken": "数据泄露，比如 KYC 资料、电商订单、客服工单。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-15.wav",
   "start": 65.06,
   "dur": 5.28,
   "speechStart": 65.06,
   "speechEnd": 70.13
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "还有链上数据，地址的余额和交易历史。",
   "spoken": "还有链上数据，地址的余额和交易历史。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-16.wav",
   "start": 70.56,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speechStart": 70.56,
   "speechEnd": 73.673
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "三类线索拼在一起，就能筛出余额高、住址已知的目标。",
   "spoken": "三类线索拼在一起，就能筛出余额高、住址已知的目标。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-17.wav",
   "start": 74.06,
   "dur": 4.64,
   "speechStart": 74.06,
   "speechEnd": 78.523
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "接下来有两条路，一条找上门，一条攻账号。",
   "spoken": "接下来有两条路，一条找上门，一条攻账号。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-18.wav",
   "start": 78.92,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 78.92,
   "speechEnd": 83.13
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "数据泄露直接交出了住址，所以保护数据，也是在保护人身安全。",
   "spoken": "数据泄露直接交出了住址，所以保护数据，也是在保护人身安全。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep22/audio/lines/seg2-19.wav",
   "start": 83.54,
